        "subject": "feat(artifact): add lifecycle status domain model and schemas",
        "body": "Add per-kind artifact state sets (spec: Draft/Approved/Abandoned/Archived; plan:\nDraft/Approved/Stale/Abandoned/Archived), table-driven legal transitions with two\nterminal statuses and errors naming the legal set, status-line parsing scoped to the\npre-H2 header region, artifact path classification, and boundary schemas bridged to the\ndomain types. Implements spec 21 §5.2–§5.3 vocabulary with unit coverage over the full\ntransition matrix."
      },
      "title": "Artifact status domain and schemas"
    },
